sequenceDiagram
    participant P0 as Java worker
    participant P1 as PostgreSQL
    participant P2 as Neo4j
    P0->>P1: S01 Claim work using the login-bound environment and an expiring lease
    alt S01 accepted
        Note over P1: Continue with verified context
    else denied or incomplete
        break F1 stop
            Note over P1: Return restrictive result
        end
    end
    P1->>P0: S02 Commit lease and export canonical snapshot with digest
    P0->>P0: S03 Verify canonical bytes protocol identities and projection allowlist
    alt S03 accepted
        Note over P0: Continue with verified context
    else denied or incomplete
        break F1 stop
            Note over P0: Return restrictive result
        end
    end
    P0->>P2: S04 Write nodes relationships and sealed receipt in one managed transaction
    alt S04 accepted
        Note over P2: Continue with verified context
    else denied or incomplete
        break F1 stop
            Note over P2: Return restrictive result
        end
    end
    P2->>P0: S05 Commit exact verified graph or recognize an identical sealed duplicate
    alt S05 accepted
        Note over P0: Continue with verified context
    else denied or incomplete
        break F1 stop
            Note over P0: Return restrictive result
        end
    end
    P0->>P1: S06 Acknowledge the current lease and digest after the Neo4j commit
    alt S06 accepted
        Note over P1: Continue with verified context
    else denied or incomplete
        break F1 stop
            Note over P1: Return restrictive result
        end
    end
    P1->>P0: S07 Mark projected or retain delayed retry after failure or lease expiry
    Note over P0,P2: F1 F1 Stop on denied scope, stale evidence, invalid source, lease loss, digest mismatch, store outage or incomplete traversal. No certification or recovery authority is granted.
